\title{Matematisk ordliste}
\taxon{Reference}
\meta{email}{ordliste@matematikkradet.no}
\meta{external}{https://ordliste.matematikkradet.no/}
\meta{source}{https://github.com/matematisk-ordliste/matematisk-ordliste}

\p{
The Norwegian mathematical dictionary is a collection of mathematical terms in
Norwegian Bokmål, Norwegian Nynorsk and English. The dictionary is intended as a tool
to facilitate Norwegian communication in mathematics for students and researchers.
The goal is to cover terms that students encounter in mathematical studies at
university colleges and universities. We also encourage active researchers to propose
translations of terms in their own mathematical fields.
}
\p{
The dictionary was originally developed as a collaboration between the [[ntnu]], the
University of Oslo and the University of Agder, and the project was supported by The
Language Council of Norway. Currently, the Norwegian Mathematics Council is
responsible for the overall maintenance and development of the dictionary.
}
\p{
The termbase is under continuous development, and we encourage all users to propose
changes or new translations. At the projects website you will find information about
how to submit feedback, as well as a list of all contributors and a description of
our choice of linguistic conventions. It is also possible to send an e-mail to
[ordliste@matematikkradet.no](mailto:ordliste@matematikkradet.no).
}
\p{
The dictionary is available at
[ordliste.matematikkradet.no](https://ordliste.matematikkradet.no/) and on
[[termportalen]].
}
